    "title": "Wynne, Cross County junior high track teams post multiple top 10 finishes at Junior Wellman Relays - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Wynne Progress ,\n13 hours ago POCAHONTAS, Ark. — The Wynne and Cross County junior high track teams competed in the Junior Wellman Relays at Pocahontas yesterday. In the overall point totals, the Wynne boys finished second with a combined 77 points. Brookland finished in first place in the boys’ standings. Cross County took eighth place. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
